{
	"name": "AtendeBot: lead to contact and deal",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "Setup",
			"name": "Setup",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-20,
				-40
			],
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Lead to contact and deal\nA form posts to this webhook, the contact is created (or updated by phone) in AtendeBot and a deal is opened for it.\n\n1. Pick your **AtendeBot API** credential on both AtendeBot nodes.\n2. In **Create deal**, choose the pipeline (replace `<PIPELINE_ID>`).\n3. Point your form at the production URL of the **Webhook** node. It must send JSON with `name`, `phone` (with country code, digits only), `email` and `value`.\n\nTry it with: `curl -X POST <webhook-url> -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" -d '{\"name\":\"Ana Souza\",\"phone\":\"5511999998888\",\"email\":\"ana@example.com\",\"value\":1500}'`",
				"width": 520,
				"height": 330
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "webhook",
			"name": "Form post",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
			"typeVersion": 2,
			"position": [
				0,
				360
			],
			"parameters": {
				"httpMethod": "POST",
				"path": "atendebot-lead",
				"options": {}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "contact",
			"name": "Create or update contact",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-atendebot.atendeBot",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				260,
				360
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "contact",
				"operation": "upsert",
				"name": "={{ $json.body.name }}",
				"phone": "={{ $json.body.phone }}",
				"additionalFields": {
					"email": "={{ $json.body.email }}"
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "deal",
			"name": "Create deal",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-atendebot.atendeBot",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				520,
				360
			],
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "deal",
				"operation": "create",
				"title": "={{ \"Lead: \" + $(\"Form post\").item.json.body.name }}",
				"pipeline": "<PIPELINE_ID>",
				"stage": "",
				"additionalFields": {
					"value": "={{ Number($(\"Form post\").item.json.body.value) || 0 }}",
					"contact": "={{ $json.data.id }}"
				}
			}
		}
	],
	"connections": {
		"Form post": {
			"main": [
				[
					{
						"node": "Create or update contact",
						"type": "main",
						"index": 0
					}
				]
			]
		},
		"Create or update contact": {
			"main": [
				[
					{
						"node": "Create deal",
						"type": "main",
						"index": 0
					}
				]
			]
		}
	},
	"pinData": {},
	"settings": {
		"executionOrder": "v1"
	},
	"meta": {
		"templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
	}
}
